  \node[draw=ScriptureGold,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=3.4cm,minimum height=1.8cm,font=\small,align=center] (a) at (-4.6,3.2) {1:2 \ 我曾愛你們\\ \textit{I have loved you}\\ 神先開口 \ \ensuremath{\times}1};
  \node[draw=ChapterDawn,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=4.6cm,minimum height=1.8cm,font=\small,align=center] (b) at (0,3.2) {你們卻說\\ \textit{But you say}\\ 在何事上？ \ \ensuremath{\times}8};
  \node[draw=ScriptureGold,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=3.4cm,minimum height=1.8cm,font=\small,align=center] (c) at (4.6,3.2) {2:2；2:4；3:1；4:5\\ \textit{I will send}\\ 神的差遣 \ \ensuremath{\times}4};
  \draw[->,color=ScriptureGold,thick] (a) -- (b);
  \draw[->,color=ScriptureGold,thick] (b) -- (c);

  \node[draw=ChapterDawn,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=5.2cm,minimum height=1.3cm,font=\small,align=center] (m1) at (-3.2,0.6) {差遣的對象\\ \textit{咒詛、誡命、使者、以利亞}};
  \node[draw=ScriptureGold,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=5.2cm,minimum height=1.3cm,font=\small,align=center] (m2) at (3.2,0.6) {兩次「日頭」\\ \textit{1:11 \ 4:2}};
  \node[draw=ChapterDawn,fill=white,rounded corners,minimum width=9.6cm,minimum height=0.9cm,font=\small\bfseries,text=ChapterDawn,align=center] at (0,-1.4) {4:6 \ 免得我來咒詛遍地 \ \textit{lest I come and smite the land with a curse}};
  \draw[->,color=ChapterDawn,thick] (m1) -- (-3.2,-0.95);
  \draw[->,color=ScriptureGold,thick] (m2) -- (3.2,-0.95);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.8cm}

\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
全書五十五節，神先說「我曾愛你們」；人問了八次「在何事上」；神每一次都沒有收回那句話，到最後用差遣來回答：差遣咒詛與誡命（2:2；2:4）、差遣使者（3:1）、差遣以利亞（4:5）。「日頭」只出現兩次，1:11 與 4:2；全書最後一個詞是「咒詛」。
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.5cm}
{\footnotesize\color{LightGray} 「但向你們敬畏我名的人必有公義的日頭出現。」— 瑪拉基書 4:2}
\end{center}
