\begin{center}
{\Large\itshape\color{CoverGoldBright} אָהַבְתִּי אֶתְכֶם אָמַר יְהוָה}\\[0.1cm]
{\itshape\small\color{CoverMuted} {\baskervillefont "I have loved you," says the LORD} · 神的第一句話 (1:2)}

\vspace{0.25cm}

\fleuron[CoverGoldBright]\hspace{0.25cm}{\color{CoverGoldBright}\rule{1.8in}{0.4pt}}\hspace{0.25cm}\fleuron[CoverGoldBright]

\vspace{0.25cm}

{\large\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 關於本書}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\large\color{CoverGoldBright} About This Book}

\vspace{0.25cm}

\begin{minipage}{5in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
瑪拉基書是舊約的最後一卷，四章五十五節。神開口的第一句話是「我曾愛你們」；人回了八次「在何事上」——在何事上愛我們、輕看你的名、玷污你、為甚麼、煩瑣你、如何轉向、奪取你、向你說了甚麼。神沒有收回那句話，到最後用差遣來回答：差遣使者，差遣以利亞；而全書最後一個詞是「咒詛」，後面跟著「免得」。本書分六步逐節研讀全卷，以「啟示的次序」為骨幹，整合老弟兄的查經方法、加爾文、亨利與摩根的歷代注疏，以及麥克阿瑟在別處講道裏對瑪拉基書經節的解釋。

\vspace{0.3cm}

{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream}\lettrine[lines=3,findent=2pt,nindent=2pt]{\color{CoverGoldBright}M}{}alachi is the last book of the Old Testament: four chapters, fifty-five verses. The first words God speaks in it are “I have loved you,” and the people answer eight times, “How?”—how have You loved us, how have we despised Your name, how have we defiled You, how have we wearied You, how shall we return, how have we robbed You, what have we said against You. God never takes the sentence back. In the end He answers by sending: a messenger, then Elijah; and the last word of the book is “curse,” followed by “lest.” This study reads the whole book in six movements, built on the order of revelation, with Elder Wong’s way of reading Scripture, the commentary of John Calvin and Matthew Henry, G. Campbell Morgan’s exposition, and John MacArthur’s remarks on Malachi’s verses in sermons elsewhere.}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.25cm}

{\small\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 六步：從愛到日子}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\small\color{CoverGoldBright} Six Movements}

\vspace{0.3cm}

\begin{minipage}{4.7in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
\begin{tabular}{@{}cp{3.4in}l@{}}
第一步 & 愛 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} I have loved you} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 1:1-5}\\[0.25em]
第二步 & 名 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Where is My honor} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 1:6–2:9}\\[0.25em]
第三步 & 約 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} The wife of your covenant} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 2:10-16}\\[0.25em]
第四步 & 使者 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} The messenger of the covenant} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 2:17–3:5}\\[0.25em]
第五步 & 轉向 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Turn to Me} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 3:6-12}\\[0.25em]
第六步 & 日子 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} The sun of righteousness} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 3:13–4:6}\\
\end{tabular}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.25cm}

{\color{CoverGoldBright}\rule{2.3in}{0.6pt}}

